h3.modal-header.m-0.pb-0 {{title|translate}}
.modal-body
    .mb-2(translate) You can change it later, but it's unrecoverable if forgotten.
    .input-group
        input.form-control.form-control-lg(
            [type]='showPassphrase ? "text" : "password"',
            autofocus,
            [(ngModel)]='passphrase',
            #input,
            placeholder='Master passphrase',
        )
        button.btn.btn-secondary(type='button', (click)='showPassphrase = !showPassphrase')
            i.fas.fa-eye

.modal-footer
    button.btn.btn-primary(type='button', (click)='ok()', [disabled]='!canSubmit') {{buttonLabel|translate}}
    button.btn.btn-danger(type='button', (click)='cancel()', translate) Cancel
